<div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="oneColumnArticleTheme"><div id="sectionHeadingForOneColumnArticle"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Why SIPROTEC 7SD87?</span></h2></div></div></div></div></div><div class="text-start container multitextblock "><div class="row justify-content-left"><div class="col col-md-8"><p>The SIPROTEC 7SD87 is a differential protection device for selective protection and 1- or 3-pole tripping of overhead lines and cables. It supports various infeed configurations and protects transformers and compensating coils.</p><p>Protect power systems from overhead line and cable faults. Our device provides selective protection and rapid tripping, quickly isolating faults to maintain system stability and minimize downtime. An adaptive algorithm maintains sensitivity and stability, even with varying transformer errors or current-transformer saturation. Isolate faults quickly with a 9 ms minimum tripping time. Adapt the modular SIPROTEC 5 system to your specific needs through flexible I/O structures. Enhance operational security with integrated cybersecurity and provide high availability in harsh environments with conformal coating.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div id='1wnNcktqzQbZaWrYs0u4zO' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tiles_2' data-ste-section-id='1wnNcktqzQbZaWrYs0u4zO'>
