<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Enhance system safety and reliability" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Enhance system safety and reliability</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Achieve high safety with powerful protection functions for selective tripping of lines and cables. Provides robust operation even in extreme environmental conditions with conformal coating on electronic boards.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Streamline configuration and operation" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Streamline configuration and operation</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Configure all functions as required with the powerful DIGSI 5 engineering tool. Benefit from a user-friendly design for purposeful and easy handling of devices and software, simplifying your operational tasks.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Strengthen cybersecurity and future-proof systems" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Strengthen cybersecurity and future-proof systems</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Implement extensive cybersecurity functionality and meet NERC CIP and BDEW Whitepaper requirements, providing future-oriented solutions for your protection needs.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='5E8Uq9R1TaU1InG66FLzfv' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='5E8Uq9R1TaU1InG66FLzfv'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-5E8Uq9R1TaU1InG66FLzfv" class="CardsContainer" data-component-type="CardsContainer"><section id="5E8Uq9R1TaU1InG66FLzfv" class="cards-defaultBackground" role="region" aria-labelledby="section-heading-5E8Uq9R1TaU1InG66FLzfv"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Featured capabilities</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div class="row cards-container-row"><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Implement adaptive differential protection" id="G_Implement%20adaptive%20differential%20protection-0" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Implement%20adaptive%20differential%20protection-0-title" aria-describedby="G_Implement%20adaptive%20differential%20protection-0-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Implement%20adaptive%20differential%20protection-0-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Implement adaptive differential protection</h3><div id="G_Implement%20adaptive%20differential%20protection-0-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Utilize differential protection with an adaptive algorithm for robust sensitivity and stability. Operate reliably despite diverse transformer errors, current-transformer saturation and capacitive charging currents.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Configure flexible I/O with modular hardware" id="G_Configure%20flexible%20I%2FO%20with%20modular%20hardware-1" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Configure%20flexible%20I%2FO%20with%20modular%20hardware-1-title" aria-describedby="G_Configure%20flexible%20I%2FO%20with%20modular%20hardware-1-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Configure%20flexible%20I%2FO%20with%20modular%20hardware-1-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Configure flexible I/O with modular hardware</h3><div id="G_Configure%20flexible%20I%2FO%20with%20modular%20hardware-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Adjust the I/O quantity structure flexibly within the SIPROTEC 5 modular system. Choose from 12 predefined standard variants with various current/voltage transformers, binary inputs and outputs for tailored solutions.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Provide secure and redundant communication" id="G_Provide%20secure%20and%20redundant%20communication-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Provide%20secure%20and%20redundant%20communication-2-title" aria-describedby="G_Provide%20secure%20and%20redundant%20communication-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Provide%20secure%20and%20redundant%20communication-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Provide secure and redundant communication</h3><div id="G_Provide%20secure%20and%20redundant%20communication-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Integrate electrical Ethernet RJ45 for DIGSI 5 and IEC 61850. Utilize up to 4 pluggable communication modules for different and redundant protocols, including PRP and HSR redundancy, for robust data transmission.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981f40d9/lib/helpers/esm/index.module.js"></script><disw-hydrate component="CardsContainer" props-url="/props/5E8Uq9R1TaU1InG66FLzfv-en-US.json" page-id="1Ailb3Pr8b5vAFgwbKx6bC" container="comp-5E8Uq9R1TaU1InG66FLzfv"></disw-hydrate></template></div></is-land></div><div id='4XWKwFzLUdhg9W5gUfbCof' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tiles_4' data-ste-section-id='4XWKwFzLUdhg9W5gUfbCof'>
